</span></span></span><![endif]>A dist=E2ncia entre faces de furos situados =
em um
mesmo tramo seja de no m=EDnimo <i style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'>2&n=
bsp;</i><i
style=3D'mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style=3D'font-family:"Times New =
Roman",serif'>h</span></i>;</p>

<p class=3DMarca1 style=3D'mso-list:l0 level1 lfo62'><![if !supportLists]><=
